Hakeem & Habib~
If you want to master the City of New Thalos you must be well versed in
what the city can offer.  Bring me one each of Cassandra's wares.  Also 
you must go to where the statues are and topple the status of Hakeem
and Habib.  Be sure to pulverize them.  Do these 4 tasks and you will 
start to understand all of New Thalos.
~
Topple the statues of Hakeem and Habib and bring whatever Cassandra sells.
~
