Construction Crew + mercenary~
If you want to master the City of New Thalos you must be well versed in what the
city has to offer.  Stop by Patch's Smuggler's inn and buy one of each drink.  
Take them to the construction crew.  Slaughter the entire crew!  The beer is
just to taunt them.  There is also a mercenary sneaking around town.  Put an end
to his ways.
~
