by someone who doesn't like the authorities.  The Sultan's guard are
interferring with my client.  Exterminate the guard.  Bring me four heads!  My
client wants them all dead, but I fear to do that to New Thalos.

This will be an unusually tricky challenge.
~
Slay four of the sultan's guard.  Are you sure you slew the correct four?  Keep looking!
~
