#13509
Khalid & Ezra & Lightning Wand~
If you want to master the City of New Thalos you must be well versed in what the
city has to offer.  A good mason knows what it takes to cut and form stone.  A
jealous mason knows how to destroy stone.  Destroy two statues for me.  Destroy
the statue of the great desert warrior and that of the cleric.  Do not destroy
the heads, but instead bring them to me.  A wise mason also knows that thunder
from the heavens can destroy stone.  Bring me a wand from New Thalos that will
send a lightning bolt where I wish.
~
Topple the statues of the desert warrior and of the cleric.  And bring me lightning in a wand!
~
