#13512
Ragnun, Undead woodsman, gremlin and hellhound~
The forces of evil have grown strong just beyond the southern border of New
Thalos.   Venture into Drekkin Noir and exterminate a couple undead woodsman
as well as the master archer, Ragnun.

Once done there, venure further south and enter the Emerald Forest.   Find and
slay two gremlin.  Bring me the heads of these 5 victims and glory and praise
will be yours.
~
Kill Ragnun, two undead woodsman and two gremlins from beyond the river south
of New Thalos.
~
