#13513
Drekkin Noir forest guardian, Emerald forest lady ranger & ranger~
Lands beyond the city are guarded by their own kind.  Enter the dark forest
south of New Thalos and slay the forest guardian.

After that, pass further into the woods until you find an emerald forest. It
is guarded by rangers and lady rangers.   Slay one of each and bring me their
wares.  Do all this and you will be granted a reward.
~
Pass the river and enter the forests beyond and stop the forest guardian, the ranger and the lady ranger and bring their wares back to me.
~
