#13519
Old Thalos Mimics~
As you know by now, this is not the only city to be called Thalos.  Before it
was overrun by evil the first city of Thalos was a fine place to live.  It is
now called old Thalos.  It is lost somewhere in the desert and is overran by
magic.  There are mimics there that mock sensibility.  Exterminate them and
bring me their heads!

To get there head into the desert east of here then head south.  Try not to
get lost!
~
Go to old Thalos and exterminate the mimics.
~
